--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FREE USE CATEGORIES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following uses are FREE and do not require any payment or contribution:

1. PERSONAL USE
   Personal use for research, experiment, testing for the benefit of public
   knowledge, personal study, private entertainment, hobby projects, amateur
   pursuits, or religious observance, without any anticipated commercial
   application.

2. NONCOMMERCIAL ORGANIZATIONS
   Use by any charitable organization, educational institution, public research
   organization, public safety or health organization, environmental protection
   organization, or government institution regardless of the source of funding.

3. CONTRIBUTIONS BACK
   Developing feedback, changes, or additions that you contribute back to
   Gestura AI LLC on the terms of a standardized public software license such
   as the Blue Oak Model License 1.0.0, the Apache License 2.0, the MIT license,
   or the two-clause BSD license.

4. SMALL BUSINESS USE
   Commercial use by any entity with less than One Million United States
   Dollars ($1,000,000 USD) in annual gross revenue in the most recent fiscal
   year is free. Revenue from all affiliated entities under common ownership
   or control shall be aggregated for this threshold.

5. EVALUATION PERIOD
   Commercial evaluation and trial use for up to ninety (90) days to determine
   suitability for your needs.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
COMMERCIAL USE - REVENUE SHARING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

For commercial use by entities exceeding the Small Business threshold:

1. CONTRIBUTION RATE
   Three percent (3%) of gross revenue attributable to products or services
   that incorporate, are enabled by, or substantially depend on this software.

2. MINIMUM CONTRIBUTION
   If calculating attributable revenue is impractical, you may alternatively
   contribute 0.5% of total annual gross revenue.

3. PAYMENT SCHEDULE
   Contributions are due annually within ninety (90) days of fiscal year end.
   First contribution is due after the first full fiscal year of commercial use.

4. REPORTING
   Submit annual compliance reports to licensing@gestura.ai including:
   - Gross revenue attributable to this software
   - Calculation methodology
   - Contact information for verification

5. APPROVED PAYMENT MECHANISMS
   - Direct payment to Gestura AI LLC
   - GitHub Sponsors: https://github.com/sponsors/gestura-ai
   - Open Collective: https://opencollective.com/gestura

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
COMMERCIAL LICENSE ALTERNATIVES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

For entities preferring alternative terms:

1. ENTERPRISE LICENSE
   Contact licensing@gestura.ai for fixed-fee enterprise licenses that waive
   the revenue sharing requirement.

2. PARTNER PROGRAM
   Strategic partners may qualify for royalty-free licenses through the
   Gestura Partner Program. Contact partnerships@gestura.ai.

3. OEM LICENSE
   For embedding in hardware products, contact oem@gestura.ai for per-unit
   licensing terms.

